# The net of dots of a lamp's shadow on the hero's nape (../README.md): the profile from 120 cm, eight frames 0.3 s
# apart, for how the net stands in time (also with OPENGOTHIC_LIGHT_FREEZE=1). Run as lamp-stipple.bench.
# @timeout 300
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
blink off
overlay off
view clean 30
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 110 0
wait 800
watch player
cam cut
cam face 120 0 1
wait 2500
shot front
wait 400
cam cut
cam face 120 90 1
wait 1200
shot s0
wait 300
shot s1
wait 300
shot s2
wait 300
shot s3
wait 300
shot s4
wait 300
shot s5
wait 300
shot s6
wait 300
shot s7
wait 400
